      "partTitle": "Reverse Proxy Fundamentals & Dynamic Route Dispatching: Path Matching, Header Rewriting & Target Selection",
      "codeHash": "025ed844d4edee856c0e2127e3d09feb28e432366312f263de0144636bd9ac7e",
      "spec": {
